    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "Western winds are currently having a partial influence over Nepal.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। देशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "The Himalayan region of the country will be partly cloudy, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining parts of the country. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan region.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ । कोशी र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "he Himalayan region of the country will be partly cloudy, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining parts of the country. Fog will develop at a few places in the Terai region, valleys, and river basins during the morning hours There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi and Gandaki Provinces.",
